/-
L4Factoidal.XSLT4.Streaming.Usage — the operand usages of the built-in
functions, for the streamability analysis.

Spec: XSLT Streaming 4.0 editor's draft
(https://qt4cg.org/specifications/xslt-streaming-40/Overview.html, read
2026-10-28), §12.9 "Classifying Calls to Built-In Functions": one row per
function, the operand usage of each argument (A absorption, I inspection,
T transmission, N navigation). The rows were copied from the table of
§12.9 by a script; the functions with their own rules (§12.9.1 to
§12.9.22) are not in this table and have their own cases in
`Streaming.Analysis`.
-/
